    "description": "<p><strong>LIGHT DRAGON</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Size</strong> Small</p>\n<p><strong>Level</strong> 5 (<strong>EL</strong> 4); <strong>DC</strong> 19</p>\n<p><strong>Initiative</strong> +60</p>\n<p><strong>Speed</strong> 30 feet; Fly 100</p>\n<p><strong>Senses</strong> Darkvision 60’, Nightvision 120’, Scent 35’</p>\n<p><strong>Languages</strong> Gantish, Low Tongue, Wyrmish</p>\n<p><strong>ABILITY SCORES</strong> <strong>STR</strong> +1, <strong>CON</strong> +1, <strong>DEX</strong> +6, <strong>INT</strong> +1, <strong>WIS</strong> +2, <strong>CHA</strong> +3</p>\n<p><strong>SKILLS</strong> Acrobatics +13(4), Arcana +8(4), Athletics +8(4), Culture +8(4) Diplomacy +10(4), Intimidate +10(4), Meditation +8(3) Mental Focus +8(3), Nature +8(3), Perception +8(3) Power Manipulation +7(3), Sense Motive +8(3), Survival +8(3)</p>\n<p><strong>DEFENCE</strong><br>DB +24 (Base +15; Other +2; Stat +6; Status +1); DR 2<br>Fort +11, Ref +18, Will +14<br>HP 85; Immunity electricity paralysis, sleep</p>\n<p><strong>FEATS/SPECIAL</strong> Alertness, Improved Initiative, Iron Will, Lightning Reflexes,</p>\n<p><strong>Light Dragon Breath</strong> 2 AP (arcane, electricity, focus, invocation, save)<br>The dragon breathes a 30-foot line of electricity that inflicts 5d10 damage. The breath weapon has the focus trait, and any targets may make a basic Reflex save to avoid damage.</p>\n<p><strong>ATTACKS</strong><br>Bite +13 (finesse) 1d6+1 piercing plus 1d6 electricity<br>Claw +13 (agile, finesse, versatile - p) 1d5+1 slashing</p>\n<p><strong>MAGIC</strong><br>A light dragon is a High Magic caster.<br>CL 2; Spellcraft +8; PP 23<br>Spells 4 x Cantrip, 3 additional spells (max PP 2).</p>\n<p><strong>SPECIAL ABILITIES BY LEVEL</strong> 7: Flyby Attack; 9: Draconic Assault; 11: Wing Buffet; 13: Frightful Aura; 15: Draconic Shifting; 17: Shocking Aura; 19: Reflective Scales; 21: Spell Resilience</p>\n<p><em>A light dragon is a majestic and radiant creature, adorned with shimmering, luminous scales that emit a gentle and enchanting glow, symbolizing purity and benevolence.</em></p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> hatched by Dragon Tamer at level 5, with the skill ranks printed (B10-7), the feats printed (Lightning Reflexes granted free, B10-9), its languages, immunities and weakness. The breath is 5d10 at 5 and a die a level after (C5), a Focus ability with a basic Reflex save at the creature DC; it grows as a line with the table. Its specials arrive by its own level from the system's Creature Codex. Its DB is the printed block's (Graham, 28 October 2026): the system's creature rule, half its level as an other bonus and its class bonus − 2 as a status bonus. Its natural attacks follow the system's one size ladder (B10-10).</p>",
